(7719294, 1269953, 30861, '<td valign="top">Heck of a portrait, Jeb...</td>', 'Heck of a portrait, Jeb...', '2022-04-27 01:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719300, 1269923, 50641, '<td valign="top">So sorry I clicked on this.</td>', 'So sorry I clicked on this.', '2022-04-27 01:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719303, 1269930, 50641, '<td valign="top">Rage, rage?</td>', 'Rage, rage?', '2022-04-27 03:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719307, 1269939, 114285, '<td valign="top">Would love to know what was going on here. Hes got a phone in one hand and looks like a walkie-talkie in the other. Or I could be totally wrong.<br/> <br/>This really fits the challenge.</td>', 'Would love to know what was going on here. Hes got a phone in one hand and looks like a walkie-talkie in the other. Or I could be totally wrong. This really fits the challenge.', '2022-04-27 07:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719325, 1269890, 42733, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.', '2022-04-27 11:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719326, 1269891, 42733, '<td valign="top">Love, love, love!!</td>', 'Love, love, love!!', '2022-04-27 11:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719327, 1269934, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top four.</td>', 'In my top four.', '2022-04-27 11:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719328, 1269945, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top four.</td>', 'In my top four.', '2022-04-27 11:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719348, 1269711, 87808, '<td valign="top">To me, it sort of just looks she is studying.  I am no expert, but this is what I do, when I am photoshop, I get my hands and make a tunnel and then look at the close up through my hands and make the tunnel of hand wider, that way I can see what a good crop would be. For myself I would have done this and cropped at her chest and at the left side of her hair, cut out the person in the background.  That would have looked more like despair or sadness. But that is just me.</td>', 'To me, it sort of just looks she is studying.  I am no expert, but this is what I do, when I am photoshop, I get my hands and make a tunnel and then look at the close up through my hands and make the tunnel of hand wider, that way I can see what a good crop would be. For myself I would have done this and cropped at her chest and at the left side of her hair, cut out the person in the background.  That would have looked more like despair or sadness. But that is just me.', '2022-04-27 14:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719349, 1269652, 87808, '<td valign="top">Personally, for me, I would have cropped much more of the sides off and just really had the two runners and the runner that is down. Much more dramatic because you almost have a tunnel vision, especially with that fantastic tunnel to the historic London buildings.</td>', 'Personally, for me, I would have cropped much more of the sides off and just really had the two runners and the runner that is down. Much more dramatic because you almost have a tunnel vision, especially with that fantastic tunnel to the historic London buildings.', '2022-04-27 14:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719351, 1269803, 87808, '<td valign="top">He is so cute, that this is not despair at all, it is cute fluffy and I want one, let me hang this on my wall as it is fantastic.</td>', 'He is so cute, that this is not despair at all, it is cute fluffy and I want one, let me hang this on my wall as it is fantastic.', '2022-04-27 14:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719352, 1269918, 87808, '<td valign="top">Cropping this would have made this sad scene much more dramatic cropped at the white crash front and at the Zedra crossing. so your main focus is the poor guy on the ground, (who I hope did manage to get up!) and the crashed into car. Taking the power line out too would be good. But that is just my opinion.</td>', 'Cropping this would have made this sad scene much more dramatic cropped at the white crash front and at the Zedra crossing. so your main focus is the poor guy on the ground, (who I hope did manage to get up!) and the crashed into car. Taking the power line out too would be good. But that is just my opinion.', '2022-04-27 14:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719353, 1269939, 87808, '<td valign="top">A crop would have helped this, so the people on the left are not there, would have made this more impactful.</td>', 'A crop would have helped this, so the people on the left are not there, would have made this more impactful.', '2022-04-27 14:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719354, 1269923, 87808, '<td valign="top">Blue juice, now this is sad.</td>', 'Blue juice, now this is sad.', '2022-04-27 14:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719355, 1269945, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous, it conveys emotion, fantastic lighting and black and white, just wish it had been cropped more to his face, as it is an outstanding face</td>', 'This is fabulous, it conveys emotion, fantastic lighting and black and white, just wish it had been cropped more to his face, as it is an outstanding face', '2022-04-27 14:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719357, 1269929, 87808, '<td valign="top">Stunning portrait, with so much emotion, well done indeed!</td>', 'Stunning portrait, with so much emotion, well done indeed!', '2022-04-27 14:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719358, 1269706, 87808, '<td valign="top">I love this type of photography with models. Excellent work, well done, 9</td>', 'I love this type of photography with models. Excellent work, well done, 9', '2022-04-27 14:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719364, 1269946, 30861, '<td valign="top">Utterly gorgeous in its own, despairing way. One of my two top picks in this challenge. Love the title.</td>', 'Utterly gorgeous in its own, despairing way. One of my two top picks in this challenge. Love the title.', '2022-04-27 15:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719514, 1269894, 38162, '<td valign="top">Despair and necessity for survival not the same thing. Ive been there and for same reasons I dont shoot US sidewalk sleeping or begging as I find it exploitive. Tough challenge.  All this aside on merit a 6 from me. GL.</td>', 'Despair and necessity for survival not the same thing. Ive been there and for same reasons I dont shoot US sidewalk sleeping or begging as I find it exploitive. Tough challenge.  All this aside on merit a 6 from me. GL.', '2022-05-01 14:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719577, 1269945, 124815, '<td valign="top">Powerful</td>', 'Powerful', '2022-05-02 18:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719634, 1269928, 97225, '<td valign="top">Desperately sad. My condolences to those involved. 10</td>', 'Desperately sad. My condolences to those involved. 10', '2022-05-03 23:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719635, 1269934, 97225, '<td valign="top">And the other side of that coin is people who remained missing to their loved ones and despair for all of them.</td>', 'And the other side of that coin is people who remained missing to their loved ones and despair for all of them.', '2022-05-03 23:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719636, 1269858, 97225, '<td valign="top">Terrible that humanity must cycle through this time and time again.</td>', 'Terrible that humanity must cycle through this time and time again.', '2022-05-03 23:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719638, 1269929, 97225, '<td valign="top">Palpable!</td>', 'Palpable!', '2022-05-03 23:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719641, 1269929, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whew!  That certainly says it.  This type of photo is my heart.  And this is perfection!  Totally worthy of top honors in this challenge.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Whew!  That certainly says it.  This type of photo is my heart.  And this is perfection!  Totally worthy of top honors in this challenge.  Congratulations!', '2022-05-04 01:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719642, 1269928, 114285, '<td valign="top">That would surely be one of the hardest things to go through.<br/> <br/>Well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'That would surely be one of the hardest things to go through. Well deserved ribbon.', '2022-05-04 01:10:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719644, 1269945, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh... I see intense despair in those eyes filling up with tears. My empathy makes me feel teary just looking into that soulful face!</td>', 'Oh... I see intense despair in those eyes filling up with tears. My empathy makes me feel teary just looking into that soulful face!', '2022-05-04 01:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719645, 1269890, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous!  The perfect amount of light on the darkness the scene conveys.</td>', 'This is fabulous!  The perfect amount of light on the darkness the scene conveys.', '2022-05-04 01:17:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719646, 1269746, 24454, '<td valign="top">This type of photography has my heart.  I''ve developed relationships with many people from scenes like this.  Buying them lunch, or bringing them soup on a cold day.  You''ve captured the despair to perfection!</td>', 'This type of photography has my heart.  I''ve developed relationships with many people from scenes like this.  Buying them lunch, or bringing them soup on a cold day.  You''ve captured the despair to perfection!', '2022-05-04 01:19:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719647, 1269818, 24454, '<td valign="top">Such emptiness in his countenance.  Despair captured excellently!</td>', 'Such emptiness in his countenance.  Despair captured excellently!', '2022-05-04 01:20:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719648, 1269826, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a very emotive photo.  It touches deep inside me!</td>', 'This is a very emotive photo.  It touches deep inside me!', '2022-05-04 01:21:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719650, 1269858, 24454, '<td valign="top">Indeed!  The despair of life on this earth done forever.  The light on this image is striking and perfect for conveying despair.</td>', 'Indeed!  The despair of life on this earth done forever.  The light on this image is striking and perfect for conveying despair.', '2022-05-04 01:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719651, 1269939, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes... it makes me wonder the story behind this powerful image.</td>', 'Yes... it makes me wonder the story behind this powerful image.', '2022-05-04 01:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719652, 1269918, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooh... a desperate scene for sure.  I hope it ended well?</td>', 'Oooooh... a desperate scene for sure.  I hope it ended well?', '2022-05-04 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719653, 1269923, 24454, '<td valign="top">Thank you for telling us the happy ending!  What a terribly sad story!  Life!  It''s just so sad and despairing sometimes!</td>', 'Thank you for telling us the happy ending!  What a terribly sad story!  Life!  It''s just so sad and despairing sometimes!', '2022-05-04 01:30:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719654, 1269891, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww!  Pooor little guy!  I hope mom came home soon!</td>', 'Awwwwwww!  Pooor little guy!  I hope mom came home soon!', '2022-05-04 01:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719655, 1269931, 24454, '<td valign="top">I can actually feel your empathy for the fish, Wendy!  It hurts me to see any animal suffer.  Your wildlife photography capturing nature at its most brutal is powerful.  I know the birds need to eat... but I still hate it that it has to be at the expense of another creature just doing life''s brutal death.  Most people think I''m crazy, but..... I look forward to Heaven where the lion will lay down with the lamb and there will be no more death!</td>', 'I can actually feel your empathy for the fish, Wendy!  It hurts me to see any animal suffer.  Your wildlife photography capturing nature at its most brutal is powerful.  I know the birds need to eat... but I still hate it that it has to be at the expense of another creature just doing life''s brutal death.  Most people think I''m crazy, but..... I look forward to Heaven where the lion will lay down with the lamb and there will be no more death!', '2022-05-04 01:36:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719656, 1269925, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very artsy, and would likely be juried into an art gallery exhibit... but this crowd is a little harsh on this kind of art, aren''t they.  I''m actually very drawn into this image!</td>', 'This is very artsy, and would likely be juried into an art gallery exhibit... but this crowd is a little harsh on this kind of art, aren''t they.  I''m actually very drawn into this image!', '2022-05-04 01:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719657, 1269923, 36999, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Thank you for telling us the happy ending!  What a terribly sad story!  Life!  It''s just so sad and despairing sometimes! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you.  The image is truly the epitome of despair in my view.  I knew it had the potential to totally bomb (which it did) or do very well as composition-wise it''s a very good image and it''s processed well but it just hits too hard to get to that other side. It''s totally authentic but could have been easily staged as well.</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Thank you for telling us the happy ending!  What a terribly sad story!  Life!  It''s just so sad and despairing sometimes!   Thank you.  The image is truly the epitome of despair in my view.  I knew it had the potential to totally bomb (which it did) or do very well as composition-wise it''s a very good image and it''s processed well but it just hits too hard to get to that other side. It''s totally authentic but could have been easily staged as well.', '2022-05-04 01:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719658, 1269928, 97225, '<td valign="top">Heart-breaking, Sandy. Just reading the story brings tears to the eyes. It was very brave of you to do this photo shoot. The ribbon is well deserved. (Should have been blue.)</td>', 'Heart-breaking, Sandy. Just reading the story brings tears to the eyes. It was very brave of you to do this photo shoot. The ribbon is well deserved. (Should have been blue.)', '2022-05-04 01:49:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719659, 1269929, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue. Great capture of emotion.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue. Great capture of emotion.', '2022-05-04 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719667, 1269923, 87808, '<td valign="top">In my voting this came 7th place, a very sad and desperate picture really. Tugs on anyone that knows what blue juice is and has been there. I am so sorry about the brave foal. The ending for the poor Mum though is happy as she gets another chance. Sorry you guys had to go through this.</td>', 'In my voting this came 7th place, a very sad and desperate picture really. Tugs on anyone that knows what blue juice is and has been there. I am so sorry about the brave foal. The ending for the poor Mum though is happy as she gets another chance. Sorry you guys had to go through this.', '2022-05-04 09:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719677, 1269891, 87808, '<td valign="top">I see this every day with my dogs, so this actually got in my top 10. It is subtle. The one thing though for me, is it seems like it is tilting, which it is not, your house is tilting. It is a weird, phenomenal as I can see the bench is straight, but that left side is closer to the camera, so it looks slidey.</td>', 'I see this every day with my dogs, so this actually got in my top 10. It is subtle. The one thing though for me, is it seems like it is tilting, which it is not, your house is tilting. It is a weird, phenomenal as I can see the bench is straight, but that left side is closer to the camera, so it looks slidey.', '2022-05-04 10:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719678, 1269892, 87808, '<td valign="top">I can absolutely see where you were going with this. The scenery is too happy. Now if it was a single bloom in a vase with that long gorgeous stem, then that would have absolutely highlighted the death of the blooms and been an abstract looking type despair. You are absolutely spot on those with sharpness and colour.</td>', 'I can absolutely see where you were going with this. The scenery is too happy. Now if it was a single bloom in a vase with that long gorgeous stem, then that would have absolutely highlighted the death of the blooms and been an abstract looking type despair. You are absolutely spot on those with sharpness and colour.', '2022-05-04 10:10:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719691, 1269928, 86447, '<td valign="top">I almost can''t look at this image, Sandy.<br/> <br/>I appreciate you sharing it and the story, but it just hits me too hard.<br/> <br/>It''s perfect for the challenge.  <br/> <br/>I hope they have (or have had) another baby since then.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I almost can''t look at this image, Sandy. I appreciate you sharing it and the story, but it just hits me too hard. It''s perfect for the challenge.   I hope they have (or have had) another baby since then. ', '2022-05-04 11:19:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719693, 1269928, 24454, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> I almost can''t look at this image, Sandy.<br/>I hope they have (or have had) another baby since then. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I totally understand, Lydia.  Thats why I hesitated to share it.  But my friend has been very open about sharing her story.  Shes been a big help for others having gone through this.<br/> <br/>The good news is yes she has other children.  She is the mother of the twins that won a blue ribbon in the Symmetry challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: I almost can''t look at this image, Sandy.I hope they have (or have had) another baby since then.   I totally understand, Lydia.  Thats why I hesitated to share it.  But my friend has been very open about sharing her story.  Shes been a big help for others having gone through this. The good news is yes she has other children.  She is the mother of the twins that won a blue ribbon in the Symmetry challenge.', '2022-05-04 11:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719709, 1269918, 163081, '<td valign="top">It happened right when we were riding the motorcycle on the other lane. After the shot we went to help the guy but he was not moving. Ambulance arrived shortly after and took him away. I don''t know more of his condition. <br/>To Juliet; I cropped already but wanted to leave more of the scene intact to tell what happened.</td>', 'It happened right when we were riding the motorcycle on the other lane. After the shot we went to help the guy but he was not moving. Ambulance arrived shortly after and took him away. I don''t know more of his condition. To Juliet; I cropped already but wanted to leave more of the scene intact to tell what happened.', '2022-05-04 13:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719711, 1269928, 43565, '<td valign="top">I can feel the emotion. Thank you for sharing the photo and the story.</td>', 'I can feel the emotion. Thank you for sharing the photo and the story.', '2022-05-04 14:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719714, 1269929, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, good eye and nice editing and framing. <br/>I couldn''t;t help but wonder if he let you take this image or if it was candid.</td>', 'Congratulations, good eye and nice editing and framing. I couldn''t;t help but wonder if he let you take this image or if it was candid.', '2022-05-04 18:01:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719715, 1269928, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congrats<br/>This image makes me cry. I can''t believe such a sad thing could happen and I am sure it does. It devastates me to image this life that will never be and the soul of this poor woman to bare such a loss. :''(</td>', 'CongratsThis image makes me cry. I can''t believe such a sad thing could happen and I am sure it does. It devastates me to image this life that will never be and the soul of this poor woman to bare such a loss. :''(', '2022-05-04 18:04:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719716, 1269945, 122678, '<td valign="top">This image is absolutely incredible! I love so much about it I don''t know where to begin. I love that you almost shot it like a mug shot. I love that his eyes are glassy and the look in them tells a sad story. I think in this image is amazing in every aspect for this challenge and as a documentation sign of our times.</td>', 'This image is absolutely incredible! I love so much about it I don''t know where to begin. I love that you almost shot it like a mug shot. I love that his eyes are glassy and the look in them tells a sad story. I think in this image is amazing in every aspect for this challenge and as a documentation sign of our times.', '2022-05-04 18:09:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719717, 1269890, 122678, '<td valign="top">Very nice and a very good tell all story.</td>', 'Very nice and a very good tell all story.', '2022-05-04 18:11:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719718, 1269746, 122678, '<td valign="top">I gave this a nine. I like the image, its classic and I like the angle. Maybe a little over processed, but still a very nice image.</td>', 'I gave this a nine. I like the image, its classic and I like the angle. Maybe a little over processed, but still a very nice image.', '2022-05-04 18:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719719, 1269918, 122678, '<td valign="top">Wow, I was your 9. I pray he is okay and survived. What a moment to capture! <br/>So sad...</td>', 'Wow, I was your 9. I pray he is okay and survived. What a moment to capture! So sad...', '2022-05-04 18:15:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719726, 1269929, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Barroness:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations, good eye and nice editing and framing. <br/>I couldn''t help but wonder if he let you take this image or if it was candid. </i></td></tr></table> This was a candid. But after I took this shot I waited until he noticed me, asked for a permission (which was granted) and took a more "proper" portrait of him. He had a striking face.</td>', 'Originally posted by Barroness: Congratulations, good eye and nice editing and framing. I couldn''t help but wonder if he let you take this image or if it was candid.  This was a candid. But after I took this shot I waited until he noticed me, asked for a permission (which was granted) and took a more "proper" portrait of him. He had a striking face.', '2022-05-04 21:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719727, 1269928, 30214, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine taking this photo... You are a strong woman Sandy, and a true photographer.</td>', 'I can''t imagine taking this photo... You are a strong woman Sandy, and a true photographer.', '2022-05-04 21:33:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719728, 1269928, 175219, '<td valign="top">Thanks for sharing, my family also had this experience. Words can not convey my gratitude for this. May peace find its way into your heart.</td>', 'Thanks for sharing, my family also had this experience. Words can not convey my gratitude for this. May peace find its way into your heart.', '2022-05-04 22:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719758, 1269928, 19825, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. Such a heartbreaking story.</td>', 'Powerful image. Such a heartbreaking story.', '2022-05-05 12:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719759, 1269928, 141319, '<td valign="top">What a heartbreaking story and what an emotional image. Although non of her children will ever replace this baby, at least she has the joy of having children.</td>', 'What a heartbreaking story and what an emotional image. Although non of her children will ever replace this baby, at least she has the joy of having children.', '2022-05-05 13:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719761, 1269919, 87808, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this photo. Here is a thing that I do, I make a tunnel with my hand when looking at a photo, making it bigger or smaller to see if a crop would be a good idea. For this and huge close up crop would have had such an impact on the viewer in my opinion. It would have just shown the face, maybe an ear cropped out. Try it out and see if you like the results of the hand tunnel. (I have to come up with a better name than hand tunnel))</td>', 'I keep coming back to this photo. Here is a thing that I do, I make a tunnel with my hand when looking at a photo, making it bigger or smaller to see if a crop would be a good idea. For this and huge close up crop would have had such an impact on the viewer in my opinion. It would have just shown the face, maybe an ear cropped out. Try it out and see if you like the results of the hand tunnel. (I have to come up with a better name than hand tunnel))', '2022-05-05 14:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719765, 1269929, 147247, '<td valign="top">I knew this was a winner! Congratulations!</td>', 'I knew this was a winner! Congratulations!', '2022-05-05 17:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719766, 1269928, 147247, '<td valign="top">Thank you for sharing the story behind the photo. Heartbreaking indeed. Hope the parents have overcome this loss.</td>', 'Thank you for sharing the story behind the photo. Heartbreaking indeed. Hope the parents have overcome this loss.', '2022-05-05 17:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719767, 1269945, 147247, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are indeed full of despair He seems to have a lot on his mind Hes been through a LOT!</td>', 'Those eyes are indeed full of despair He seems to have a lot on his mind Hes been through a LOT!', '2022-05-05 17:50:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719792, 1269945, 124815, '<td valign="top">These eyes are full of mal de vivre - sickness of living and in the same time with a glimmer of hope. There is also resentment and acceptance. Despair comes sometimes in this combination until an angels wing touches the mans  heart! The image of moments in life. Contained despair. <br/>My highest mark in this challenge</td>', 'These eyes are full of mal de vivre - sickness of living and in the same time with a glimmer of hope. There is also resentment and acceptance. Despair comes sometimes in this combination until an angels wing touches the mans  heart! The image of moments in life. Contained despair. My highest mark in this challenge', '2022-05-06 01:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719801, 1269929, 122678, '<td valign="top">Thank you, wonderful image.</td>', 'Thank you, wonderful image.', '2022-05-06 07:35:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7719872, 1269928, 38032, '<td valign="top">incredible story. THank you.</td>', 'incredible story. THank you.', '2022-05-07 18:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
